  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A profound sense of stillness settles upon the one who dons this grey weave. While the fabric offers only a modest shield against physical harm, it creates an impenetrable sanctuary for the mind against the most potent of sorceries."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Coarse, grey-woven fabric hangs with a stiffened drape, as if the threads have absorbed the grit of mountain stone. It muffles the movement of the wearer, providing a dull, grounding sensation against the skin."
    }
